/-!
# Auxiliary lemmas for [DIR] Theorem 1.1 and Corollary 1.9

This file was automatically generated by Claude.

Auxiliary material for `Thm_1_1.lean` (also used for [DIRX] Theorem 1.2):

* elementary facts on the cube: $e_i\oplus e_i=0$, $i\mapsto e_i$ is injective, $h_A$ takes
  values in $\{0,\dots,n\}$;
* subcubes: for $A=\{x : x_i=a_i\ (i\in S)\}$, $|A|=2^{-\#S}$ and $h_A=\#S$ on $A$ (the equality
